				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Arial" size="11"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[We are pleased to inform you that your application with CBZ Bank has been reviewed and approved. Your new account is now fully set up and ready for use. Please find your account details summarised below.]]></text>
