					<font fontName="Arial" size="11"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[For your reference, we have enclosed the Terms and Conditions applicable to your account. To begin transacting, you may deposit funds or initiate a transfer into your account using the details outlined in the table above.]]></text>
